# Task 4: inject: threading — basic infrastructure implemented.
# The inject_default is extracted from MacroDecl params and passed as `binding` arg.
# Full inject: syntax (inside [let ...] params as inject: name) is not yet in the parser.
# See macros-v2.md for the full inject: design.
# This test keeps a simple defmacro sanity check.
[defmacro simple [args] [get 0 args]]
[simple 42]
=== out
Int(42)
